WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.713
Ama has 20 books and receives 8 more. How many now? Let us think carefully. Add 20

00:00:05.713 --> 00:00:08.307
and 8. The answer is 28. Great work!

00:00:09.117 --> 00:00:14.915
Kofi has 31 pencils and gives away 9. How many remain? Let us think carefully.

00:00:14.915 --> 00:00:18.781
Subtract 9 from 31. The answer is 22. Great work!

00:00:19.617 --> 00:00:26.048
Abena has 24 oranges. She gets 10, then gives away 3. How many remain? Let us think

00:00:26.048 --> 00:00:30.966
carefully. First add 10; next subtract 3. The answer is 31. Great work!

00:00:31.783 --> 00:00:38.355
Ama has 26 beads and receives 11 more. How many now? Let us think carefully. Add 26

00:00:38.355 --> 00:00:41.447
and 11. The answer is 37. Great work!
